    "title": "Special Weather Statement by NWS - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Check NWS updates here At 849 PM MDT, Doppler radar was tracking a strong thunderstorm 10 miles west of Rockypoint, or 38 miles south of Broadus, moving east at 15 mph. HAZARD...Penny size hail. SOURCE...Radar indicated. IMPACT...Minor hail damage to vegetation is possible. Locations impacted include... Rockypoint.",
